---
const openBoxImg = 'https://songdeck.shop/cdn/shop/files/Open_Box_Mockup.jpg?v=1728399000&width=1070';
const collageImg = '/media/library/collage-mantrapakket-klein.webp';
---

<section class="sk-section" id="what">
  <div class="sk-wrap">
    <div class="sk-what-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="sk-eyebrow">The deck</p>
        <h2 class="sk-h2">Not a deck of answers — <em>a deck of songs</em>.</h2>
        <div class="sk-prose" style="margin-top:18px">
          <p>
            Songdeck is an oracle deck with one difference: every card can sing. Thirty-six cards,
            each with its own illustration and title — <em>There is Joy in My Voice</em>, to name
            one — and a few written lines to take the drawing further. On the back of every card
            sits a QR code. Scan it with the free app, and that card's own music plays: a song, a
            mantra, or a soundscape from the Authentic Singing work.
          </p>
          <p>
            Drawing a card is already a small ritual — a question, a shuffle, an answer you didn't
            choose yourself. The Songdeck adds the part words can't do. The card doesn't just tell
            you something. It sings it.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sk-what-media">
        <img
          class="sk-what-photo"
          src={openBoxImg}
          alt="The Songdeck box open, showing the cards inside the gold tray, next to a closed box"
          loading="lazy"
        />
        <img
          class="sk-what-collage"
          src={collageImg}
          alt="A grid of card illustrations from the deck — flowers, sea, sky, birds, hands"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="sk-feature-row">
      <div class="sk-feature">
        <i class="ph-light ph-cards" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h3>36 unique cards</h3>
        <p>
          Each with its own illustration and title — an answer to the question or intention you
          drew it with.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="sk-feature">
        <i class="ph-light ph-chat-circle-text" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h3>Every card holds a message</h3>
        <p>
          A few lines alongside the music, so the drawing has somewhere to land — read it before
          the song, or after.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="sk-feature">
        <i class="ph-light ph-share-network" aria-hidden="true"></i>
        <h3>Songs you can give away</h3>
        <p>
          From the app, send a card's song to someone who doesn't own a deck. They listen for
          free.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
